privacy=hero('Privacy Policy','How this website handles the information you choose to share.','Privacy')+'<section class="section wrap rich article-body"><p>Effective 23 October 2026</p><h2>Information collected</h2><p>When you submit an inquiry, we collect your name, email address, selected service, message, optional budget and timeline, and the time you consented and submitted it.</p><h2>Why we use it</h2><p>We use inquiry details to understand your requirements, respond to your request and manage the project conversation. The form does not subscribe you to marketing communications.</p><h2>Storage and access</h2><p>Inquiries are stored in the website’s hosted database. Access to the inquiry inbox is restricted to the configured site owner through ChatGPT sign-in. The public website does not expose inquiry records.</p><h2>Service providers</h2><p>The website is hosted through ChatGPT Sites and its hosting infrastructure. Hosting providers may process technical request data under their own applicable terms. We have not added advertising trackers or third-party marketing analytics.</p><h2>Cookies and sign-in</h2><p>Public pages do not require an account. Owner administration uses platform-managed ChatGPT authentication and its necessary cookies. This site does not add marketing cookies.</p><h2>Retention and your choices</h2><p>Inquiry information is kept while needed to manage the conversation and related business requirements. You may request access, correction or removal through the contact form using the same email address and inquiry reference. Requests are reviewed and may require verification.</p><h2>What not to send</h2><p>Please do not send passwords, payment details, medical records or other sensitive personal information through the inquiry form.</p><h2>Contact and changes</h2><p>For privacy questions, use the <a class="textlink" href="/contact">contact form</a> and identify your request clearly. This policy will be updated if the website’s data handling changes.</p></section>'
page('/privacy','Privacy Policy','How KS Digital BD collects, stores and uses website inquiry information.',privacy)
terms=hero('Terms of Use','The basis for using this website and discussing a project.','Terms')+'<section class="section wrap rich article-body"><p>Effective 23 October 2026</p>'+''.join('<h2>'+h+'</h2><p>'+p+'</p>' for h,p in [('Website information','This website introduces KS Digital BD’s services, planned products and portfolio. Descriptions are informational; they do not by themselves create a service contract.'),('Products in development','Products marked Coming Soon are in development. Planned features, availability and pricing may change before release. A demo inquiry does not confirm availability, a reservation or a purchase.'),('Project agreements','Scope, fees, payment milestones, timelines, deliverables, intellectual property, confidentiality and support must be agreed separately in writing before project work begins.'),('Inquiry submissions','Provide accurate contact information and submit only information you are authorised to share. Do not use the form for spam, unlawful content or credentials. Submission creates an inquiry, not a project commitment.'),('Portfolio and content','Portfolio summaries describe the information supplied for this website. Client materials, screenshots and testimonials are published only when approved. Do not reuse third-party branding or content without permission.'),('Availability and external services','We aim to keep the website usable, but availability can be affected by hosting, maintenance or third-party services. External services have their own terms and privacy practices.'),('Questions','Use the contact form to ask about the website or a proposed project. Any additional project terms will be discussed in the applicable agreement.')])+'</section>'
